# API token for the TOPMed Imputation Server (NHLBI BioData Catalyst).
#
# 1. Sign up (free) at https://imputation.biodatacatalyst.nhlbi.nih.gov
# 2. Account → Profile → API Access → Create token
# 3. Save the token to ~/.topmed_token (one line, no quotes),
#    or export TOPMED_API_TOKEN=<token>.
#
# Do NOT commit the real token — it grants download access to every
# genome you've uploaded. .topmed_token is already in .gitignore.
#
# This is the panel to use for AFR / admixed samples (and the best
# option for everyone, really — ~97k WGS, lowest phasing switch-error
# rate). Same API as Michigan; select with
#   genepred impute michigan submit --server topmed ...
